	"_secret_comment": "This world's one SECRET (docs/home-world-and-secrets-design.md, 'Lingerlong'). reveal.type 'doorway': the Late Arch in the pool (the 'doorway' block) runs a little late, and once it opens on the evening the plaza has been saving, walking through it sets you on the evening terrace, where the place card waits on the table for two. The arch, the evening and the crossing all happen on the player's own screen, so the server only checks 'this world, standing at it'.",
