		},
		"lore": "A little folded card on the table, propped against the candle. In neat handwriting it says: 'Saved for you. Sorry we're late.' There is a second name under yours, smaller, and your companion seems to know it is theirs.",
		"reveal": {
			"type": "doorway",
			"arch": "late_arch",
			"reveal_line": "The table is laid, the candle is lit, and there is a card with your name on it."
		},
		"found_line": "You tuck the place card away. The plaza saved you an evening, and now you have the proof.",
		"home_line": "Something has changed at home.",
